sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to use priority charging for the transaction

    CSMS->>CS: UsePriorityChargingRequest (transactionId = <transactionId>, activate = true)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: transactionId must be <transactionId><br>activate must be true
    CS-->>CSMS: UsePriorityChargingResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyPriorityChargingRequest (transactionId = <transactionId>, activated = true)
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyPriorityChargingResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
